# Normalize line endings: store LF in git, check out LF on every platform.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks out CRLF, which the Biome
# formatter (LF) then flags — breaking `bun run format:check` locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize or diff as text.
*.duckdb binary
*.duckdb.bak* binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
# bun.lock is a text file (Bun binary lockfile format); keep diffable.
# Dependabot also needs text diff for Bun lockfile updates.
